 ",[257,282,283],{},"false-value"," is the bound value when unchecked, the number ",[257,286,287],{},"0"," by default. Change them when the back end uses ",[257,290,291],{},"Y"," \u002F ",[257,294,295],{},"N"," or booleans; if the whole project uses the same values, set site-wide defaults for ",[257,298,299],{},"trueValue"," and ",[257,302,303],{},"falseValue","; see ",[306,307,309],"a",{"href":308},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Ftheme\u002Fcomponent-defaults#configurable-props","Configurable props",".",[312,313],"component-example",{"name":314},"checkbox-values",[316,317,318,328],"ul",{},[319,320,321,322,324,325,327],"li",{},"When the bound value is not ",[257,323,275],{},", the checkbox shows unchecked. In the example, changing only ",[257,326,275],{}," makes the existing value no longer match, so it shows unchecked.",[319,329,330,331,333,334,310],{},"A native form submission sends ",[257,332,275],{}," instead of the browser's default ",[257,335,336],{},"on",[267,338,340],{"id":339},"label","Label",[254,342,343,345,346,349,350,310],{},[257,344,339],{}," defaults to \"Enable\" (\"啟用\" in Traditional Chinese), switching with the locale, and can be overridden with the ",[257,347,348],{},"checkbox.label"," text; see ",[306,351,47],{"href":352},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Ftheme\u002Fmessages",[312,354],{"name":355},"checkbox-label",[254,357,358,359,362],{},"The label shows on one line and is truncated when wider than its container. A tooltip shows the full text on hover or focus, or on long press on touch devices (see ",[306,360,197],{"href":361},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fhelper\u002Ftooltip#touch-long-press","); a long press that shows the tooltip does not change the checked state.",[267,364,366],{"id":365},"color-and-icon","Color and icon",[254,368,369,370,300,373,376,377,310],{},"Uses the ",[257,371,372],{},"color",[257,374,375],{},"icon"," (the checked icon) of ",[257,378,379],{},"UCheckbox",[312,381],{"name":382},"checkbox-color",[267,384,386],{"id":385},"size-and-states","Size and states",[254,388,389,390,393],{},"The frame height matches an input of the same size. While loading, a spinner of the same size replaces the checkbox and it is disabled. See ",[306,391,87],{"href":392},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon"," for the behavior shared by all states.",[312,395],{"name":396},"checkbox-states",[262,398,400],{"id":399},"examples","Examples",[267,402,404],{"id":403},"next-to-an-input","Next to an input",[254,406,407,408,411,412,415],{},"Inside a flex container, the wrapper shrinks with the available space and truncates the label. To show the full label, set ",[257,409,410],{},"ui.wrapper"," to ",[257,413,414],{},"shrink-0","; a label wider than the container is still truncated with a tooltip.",[312,417],{"name":418},"checkbox-inline",[267,420,422],{"id":421},"input-next-to-the-label","Input next to the label",[254,424,425,426,429,430,433,434,437,438,441,442,446],{},"Put an input next to the label with ",[257,427,428],{},"#append",". When the input is focused, call ",[257,431,432],{},"check()"," from the slot props to check the box too, and use ",[257,435,436],{},"labelId"," as the input's ",[257,439,440],{},"aria-labelledby",". Clicking non-interactive parts of the appended content does not change the checked state; see ",[306,443,445],{"href":444},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fchoice\u002Fcheckbox-group#item-append-content","Item append content"," for details.",[312,448],{"name":449},"checkbox-append",[267,451,453],{"id":452},"must-be-checked","Must be checked",[254,455,456,457,460,461,463,464,467],{},"For fields that must be checked, such as agreeing to terms, use ",[257,458,459],{},"v.check"," to check that the bound value equals ",[257,462,275],{}," (not ",[257,465,466],{},"v.literal",", which would narrow the UForm state type).",[312,469],{"name":470},"checkbox-validation",[262,472,474],{"id":473},"props","Props",[476,477],"component-props",{"name":478},"ShuoCheckbox",[254,480,481,482,485,486,489,490,489,493,489,496,489,49